    {"BP_SO_SimpleBool_C", {"MyBool", nullptr, nullptr, nullptr}, false, false},
    // [R5-WORLD] G1: a second boolean on classes that were already watched.  Field
    // 0 keeps the Lua's bare-owner key ("<hash of owner>"); a later field is keyed
    // on "<owner>.<field>" first, so no existing key moves and an old-build peer
    // still agrees with this build about every key they share.
    {"BPSO_CraftingItemPickup_C",
